# m7_bosses (track B2, M7 bosses): the identity check through all four bosses, each in its
# busiest phase, with splits, turns and re-aims in flight and a hold-B rewind in each fight.
# Endless probe mode from 31. Input: A at 30, then from 60 the M2 sweep holding A (up 40 / hold
# 20 / down 40 / hold 20); B held 800..819, 2750..2769, 4600..4629 and 6300..6329. The bosses
# are forced with the test hook debug_boss (id | start phase << 4, not World state; set only
# while no boss is alive) and reached with debug_warp; debug_next_stage clears each one away:
#   32 Heisenbug from its final phase (P3: teleports, pellet rings, sniper lines); it dies
#      ~1300 (stage_clears 1).
#   2001 Mandelbug from P2 (orbs whose splits split again); P2 times out ~3670 (no crate),
#      P3 (aimed walls, split rings).
#   3901 Schrodinbug from P3 (two bodies, mirrored stop-and-go rings and spirals).
#   5501 Bohrbug from its final phase (tracking walls, curving spirals, stop-and-go rain); the
#      sweep cannot finish it in 30 s, so it escapes ~7850 (phase 3, stage_clears stays 1).
# debug_history_check (0 = the World rebuilt from keyframe + input log is identical) is pinned
# every 10 updates, on every held frame and on the two after each release; 0 on every frame
# 40..8399 when written. With waves.stage_count 1 (before track B1) each debug_next_stage is
# a new loop (boss HP x 1.3 per loop, rank +400); with four stages the HP and some outcomes
# (the Bohrbug escape) may change and the outcome pins need re-pinning; the id, phase and
# identity pins should not.
--frames 8400
--call-at "31 debug_probe" --call-at "32 debug_boss:32" --call-at "33 debug_warp" --call-at "2000 debug_next_stage" --call-at "2001 debug_boss:17" --call-at "2002 debug_warp" --call-at "3900 debug_next_stage" --call-at "3901 debug_boss:34" --call-at "3902 debug_warp" --call-at "5500 debug_next_stage" --call-at "5501 debug_boss:67" --call-at "5502 debug_warp"
--dump-exports debug_state,debug_hits,debug_stage_clears,debug_stage_index,debug_boss_id
--at "400 debug_boss_id == 0" --at "400 debug_boss_phase == 2" --at "799 debug_bullets > 0" --at "1400 debug_stage_clears == 1" --at "1400 debug_boss_id == 255" --at "2400 debug_boss_id == 1" --at "2400 debug_boss_phase == 1" --at "2749 debug_bullets > 40" --at "3700 debug_boss_phase == 2" --at "4300 debug_boss_id == 2" --at "4300 debug_boss_phase == 2" --at "4599 debug_bullets > 30" --at "5900 debug_boss_id == 3" --at "5900 debug_boss_phase == 4" --at "6299 debug_bullets > 30" --at "7900 debug_phase == 3" --at "7900 debug_boss_id == 255" --at "7900 debug_stage_clears == 1"
--at "40 debug_history_check == 0" --at "50 debug_history_check == 0" --at "60 debug_history_check == 0" --at "70 debug_history_check == 0" --at "80 debug_history_check == 0" --at "90 debug_history_check == 0"
